&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment with a strategic and execution-focused mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
