&lt;p&gt;Razorpay is India’s first converged payments solution company. We serve as a critical payments layer for businesses of all sizes, supporting them through their financial digitization journey. Our culture is built on open communication, minimal bureaucracy, and a commitment to mutual growth. We are an equal opportunity employer that thrives on the unique diversity of our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Sales analytics &amp;amp; strategy lead for Domestic Payments&lt;/strong&gt;, you will report directly to the &lt;strong&gt;Domestic payments Category Head / P&amp;amp;L owner&lt;/strong&gt;. This is not a traditional &quot;coordinator&quot; role; we need a high-ownership individual who can bridge the gap between high-level sales strategy and granular data execution. You will manage end-to-end delivery of complex, iterative projects that involve multiple internal teams and high-stakes business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform requirements gathering, analysis, and management of projects designed to achieve specific Domestic Payments business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dive data analytics independently to inform project direction, track performance, and identify bottlenecks—you must be comfortable pulling and analyzing your own data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain strong working relationships across Razorpay (BA, Support &amp;amp; Ops, Sales, Banking, etc.) to ensure cross-functional alignment and project success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterative Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop flexible project plans and review schedules that allow for rapid iteration based on market feedback and data insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and report key metrics regarding project progress to leadership, ensuring tactical goals align with the broader domestic payments strategy.&lt;br&gt;+1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain comprehensive project documentation to ensure scalability and knowledge sharing within the category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5-8 years of experience in program/project management, ideally within a fast-paced fintech or tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to perform complex data analytics independently (SQL/Advanced Excel); you should be able to derive insights without relying solely on a separate BA team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI native&lt;/strong&gt; : Comfort with AI tools and be the evangelist of automating end to end workflows using an AI first approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maturity &amp;amp; Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to work in an ambiguous, unstructured environment and manage diverse stakeholders with varying priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent organization skills, attention to detail, and the ability to juggle multiple competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of the payments landscape and the ability to make decisions that drive commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
